~ start
# The player gets to the city level
do Global.dim_lights(true)
do Global.control_spotlight(Global.stage.narrator, true)
Narrator: Eventually they made it to a city
do Global.control_spotlight(Global.stage.player_child_body, true)
Player: I'm sure it can't be much worse than the forest
do Global.control_spotlight(Global.stage.player_child_body, false)
do Global.dim_lights(false)
=> END